y | Saint Peter, MN","source_kind":"government","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-12","latitude":44.3239,"longitude":-93.9582,"maps_url":"https://www.openstreetmap.org/?mlat=44.3239&mlon=-93.9582#map=16/44.3239/-93.9582","access_notes":"This supports a historic-district walk, not access to the interiors of private buildings.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true},{"evidence_id":"gac-032","buckets":["college-blocks-off-campus"],"subject_name":"Minnesota Square Park block","subject_type":"street_or_district","supported_claim":"The City identifies Minnesota Square Park as the location of the Saint Peter Area Veterans Memorial.","source_url":"https://www.saintpetermn.gov/101/Community","source_title":"Community | Saint Peter, MN","source_kind":"government","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-12","latitude":44.3241,"longitude":-93.9588,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Observe city park hours and treat the memorial respectfully.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true},{"evidence_id":"gac-033","buckets":["college-blocks-off-campus"],"subject_name":"Gorman Park–library civic block","subject_type":"street_or_district","supported_claim":"The City describes Gorman Park as near the center of Saint Peter beside the Community Center and public library.","source_url":"https://saintpetermn.gov/parks","source_title":"Parks | Saint Peter, MN","source_kind":"government","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-12","latitude":44.3199,"longitude":-93.9575,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Individual buildings and park facilities maintain their own schedules and access rules.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true},{"evidence_id":"gac-034","buckets":["college-blocks-off-campus"],"subject_name":"Community Spirit Park East–Meridian Street area","subject_type":"street_or_district","supported_claim":"The City locates Community Spirit Park East at 2100 Meridian Street and identifies the combined park as a large outdoor sports com