{"complete":true,"school_name":"Gustavus Adolphus College","town_name":"Saint Peter","template_id":"college-blocks-off-campus","title":"10 Blocks Off Campus, One Reason Each","description":"Ten map-ready Saint Peter blocks and corridors, each anchored by a named destination and one practical reason to stop.","icon":"location_city","cards":[{"subject_id":"minnesota-square-south-minnesota-avenue","subject_type":"street_or_district","entity_name":"1000 block of South Minnesota Avenue at Minnesota Square Park","title":"Bring a Ball to Minnesota Square","subtitle":"1000 block of South Minnesota Avenue","notes":"Head down South Minnesota Avenue with a ball or picnic; the 1000 block combines courts, tables, a playground, and the park pavilion.","short_summary":"A recreation-ready block with several options in one city park.","evidence_claim":"The City lists basketball and tennis courts, picnic areas, a playground, and a pavilion at Minnesota Square Park.","source_url":"https://www.saintpetermn.gov/facilities/facility/details/Minnesota-Square-Park-11","source_title":"Minnesota Square Park | Facilities","source_kind":"government","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-12","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Minnesota+Square+Park%2C+1000+South+Minnesota+Avenue%2C+Saint+Peter%2C+MN","access_notes":"City park hours are 7 a.m.–10 p.m.; reserved pavilion features may not be available to drop-in visitors.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"hallett-park-north-third-street","subject_type":"street_or_district","entity_name":"1000 block of North Third Street at Hallett Park","title":"Follow the Trails Around Hallett’s Pond","subtitle":"1000 block of North Third Street","notes":"Use the North Third Street parking entrance, then choose a walking or bike loop around Hallett’s Pond and its fishing pier.","short_summary":"A pond-side block suited to a walk, ride, or fishing stop.","evidence_cla